<title>POLAND: RELPOL Q2 GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL Q2 GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
